            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Marathi for a subsidy, then the Marathi for economic."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: आंदोलन",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आंदोलन — āndolan — \"a movement; an agitation\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पाण्यासाठी गावात मोठं आंदोलन झालं. pāṇyāsāṭhī gāvāt moṭhaṁ āndolan jhālaṁ. There was a big agitation in the village for water."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Neuter."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आंदोलन (āndolan) करणे, to agitate; आंदोलक, an agitator."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आंदोलन (āndolan) is a tatsama, taken from Sanskrit āndolana, \"swinging, oscillation\" (Monier-Williams). Marathi uses it for a movement that stirs people."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
